<title>CHINA: Paribas Asia Equity names Indonesia president director.</title>
<headline>Paribas Asia Equity names Indonesia president director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paribas Asia Equity said on Thursday it has appointed James Spence as president director in Indonesia and Justin Tooth as head of Philippines sales.</p>
<p>Niall Shiner joins the firm's Hong Kong research team to cover smaller companies and Walter Lo has been appointed research manager in Malaysia, Paribas said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
